<p>I like numbers. I am a huge, huge numbers nerd.</p>
<p>This article is dedicated to the recently-passed <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Richard_K._Guy">Richard K. Guy</a>, a mathematician who dedicated many years to furthering math concepts such as set theory, small numbers theory, conceptual polygons, and recreational mathematics in general. It is also dedicated to my friends over at reddit's <a href="http://num.reddit.com">r/NUM</a>.</p>
<p>The style of the RGU-𝕐 system is a direct derivative of the <a href="http://scp-sandbox-3.wikidot.com/turbo-vision">Turbo Vision theme</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2893766); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1587495860" alt="Croquembouche" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2893766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2893766); return false;">Croquembouche</a></span>.</p>

